Privacy Policy for ssglivebot

Last updated: 10/19/2026

1. DATA WE PROCESS
   The Bot processes message content and user presence (streaming status)
   solely to respond to commands and assign streaming roles.

2. HOW WE USE DATA
   Data is used only in real time to provide the Bot's features. We do not
   sell, share, or store your data beyond what is needed for the Bot to
   function.

3. DATA STORAGE
   The Bot does not store message content or personal data in a database.

4. DISCORD'S DATA
   Data is processed through Discord's API and subject to Discord's
   Privacy Policy and Terms of Service.

